Package: openjdk-21-jre-awt
Name: OpenJDK 21 AWT/X11 Runtime
Version: 21.0.12+ios1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Depends: libiosexec1 (>= 1.3.1), libx11-6, libxext6, libxrender1, libxi6, libxtst6, libfontconfig1
Recommends: xwayland, libxrandr2, libxinerama1, libxcomposite1
Provides: java-runtime
Description: OpenJDK 21 runtime with AWT/Java2D for rootless iOS.
 The same arm64 HotSpot server VM as the headless runtime, built headful: the
 XAWT peer (libawt_xawt) draws through an X server, so AWT and Swing windows
 and the full Java2D pipeline work. Needs a running X display -- Xwayland
 against the iosc compositor -- and DISPLAY set.
 .
 Installs alongside, not over, openjdk-21-jre-headless: this runtime lives in
 its own java-21-openjdk-awt directory and claims no /usr/bin names, so the
 proven headless runtime stays exactly as it is. Select it with JAVA_HOME.
Maintainer: max
Author: OpenJDK contributors and Xios
Section: Development
Priority: optional
MinimumOSVersion: 16.0
